s que intentan, sin éxito, buscarle una familia. Pasan los años, y aunque el niño vive feliz entre los monjes, no puede dejar de añorar a su madre. Marcelino se hace amigo de un Cristo crucificado que hay en el desván del convento: habla con él y le sube de la cocina pan, vino y otros víveres que puede encontrar.","tagline":"Una Película de Ladislao Vajda"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aCQdnOoXC7JBVyWuHYJXuAfrkHQ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1EoZR0hGuuFIGlxcwChgS3qcCY6.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":62395,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aCQdnOoXC7JBVyWuHYJXuAfrkHQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aCQdnOoXC7JBVyWuHYJXuAfrkHQ.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aCQdnOoXC7JBVyWuHYJXuAfrkHQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aCQdnOoXC7JBVyWuHYJXuAfrkHQ.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1InVfv73ExXqQ1hImGw1Adn0sGw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1InVfv73ExXqQ1hImGw1Adn0sGw.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oymJ6UBnvQtphQ1hv6NRM8TXmp5.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oymJ6UBnvQtphQ1hv6NRM8TXmp5.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w4uW544NZnP9gAtYigkJCewDmi1.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/w4uW544NZnP9gAtYigkJCewDmi1.jpg","language":"en","width":1024,"height":1536},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w4uW544NZnP9gAtYigkJC